# ── FORMATO: accion (accion) ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# 2 tomas de 345 frames (14,4 s) = 29 s. Ancladas, no encadenadas.
# 736x416 porque a 512x288 el modelo produce aberraciones de color (12 medidas).
#
@TIPO accion
@ESCENA A dim study at dusk lit only by a warm desk lamp on a wooden table, tall bookshelves behind, a window showing deep blue evening sky. A man of about fifty-five with a close-cropped salt-and-pepper beard, in a charcoal grey wool sweater,
@AMBIENTE A quiet room tone with the faint hum of a distant street beyond the window, and the soft creak of old wood.
@MUSICA A sparse low sustained cello note held quietly, restrained and continuous, unchanging in character.

TOMA|walks slowly into frame from the left, stops beside the table, and looks down at the open book.|inicio|
TOMA|reaches out, rests one hand on the table, and stands still looking down.|ancla|
TOMA|stands still beside the table, looking down at the open book.|ancla|
TOMA|turns his head slowly toward the window, then looks down again.|ancla|
